<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Bank cuts lending rate.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Bank cuts lending rate.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's largest commercial bank Bangkok Bank Plc said on Monday it was cutting its minimum overdraft rate (MOR) by 25 basis points to 13.25 percentage with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The minimum lending rate (MLR) and minimum retail rate (MRR) remained unchanged at 13.25 and 13.00 percent respectively, the bank said said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
